  "summary": "A piano is a keyboard instrument that produces sound when its keys are depressed, activating an action mechanism where hammers strike strings. Modern pianos have a row of 88 black and white keys—with the exception of the Bosendörfer and Stuart \u0026 Sons pianos—and tuned to a chromatic scale in equal temperament. A musician who specializes in piano is called a pianist.",
